# X=2 exiles two creature cards and gives six counters. Becoming a copy of Grizzly Bears "except it's 0/0 and has this
# ability" keeps the counters (a 6/6 Bears) and the {2} ability, and that ability still reads every card this object
# exiled, however it exiled it - the owner's ruling (jschibel, 2026-11-24): the "as it enters" exile is gone from the copy,
# but "cards exiled with it" puts no requirement on how they were exiled. So Llanowar Elves, still in exile, is a legal
# target of a second activation, and the 6/6 Bears becomes a 6/6 Llanowar Elves. Both cards stay in exile.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Mimeoplasm, Revered One
Swamp
Swamp
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
